      "created_at": "2016-02-02T19:23:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And seriously, how many times do you think Expatriette's stash of ammo and explosives have gone up in smoke?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That was the decoy stash. &nbsp;There are many more scattered in boltholes throughout the city.</p>\n<p>As for HQ's, I always saw the Prime Wardens as a really low-tech group. &nbsp;Like meeting in the garage itself, or Faye's private eye office, or in someone's living room.</p>",
