      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Animus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/animus/48/1887_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Animus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;It's clear that the Freedom Five's headquarters is Freedom Tower.&nbsp;From the ARG, we now know that the Prime Wardens headquarters is in Atlantis (their comic cover referred to their Atlantean hideout).&nbsp;What about Dark Watch? Is their an official canon answer? If not, how do you envision the Dark Watch headquarters?&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Link to this ?</p>",
